For a performance review, I can select the campaigns and dates, compare against another period, use an objective-based KPI pack and choose which metrics matter. Daily charts, drivers, creative performance and the evidence table let me follow the result into the detail. Saved reports retain the data and settings so I can reopen a review and refresh it when needed.

The current release centres on Overview, Performance and competitor research. Other connector and workspace experiments remain outside this release. The case study focuses on the workflow available now.
